      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The above-entitled matter came on for oral argument before the Supreme Court of the United States at 11:25 a.m."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2021-20-1566",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "9cb3e5c25d4226125fe34645c5b1603fa7c86c76efed1d42263fea0a4e2d0301",
      "evidence_id": "ev-9cb3e5c25d42-0000-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 6,
        "start": 6
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: Mr. Boies, if we\nthink that the district court and the court of\nappeals did, in fact, apply Spanish law, would\nhave applied Spanish law in the exact same way\nto a private person, wouldn't you lose?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Masha G. Hansford",
      "case_id": "2021-20-1566",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "9cb3e5c25d4226125fe34645c5b1603fa7c86c76efed1d42263fea0a4e2d0301",
      "evidence_id": "ev-9cb3e5c25d42-0000-0002",
      "kind": "amicus_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 20,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MS. HANSFORD: Mr. Chief Justice, and\nmay it please the Court:\nRather than creating an independent\nliability standard for FSIA cases, Congress\ndirected that a foreign state should be liable\nin the same manner and to the same extent as a\nprivate individual under like circumstances.\nThat language provides a clear answer to the\nquestion presented."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2021-20-1566",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "9cb3e5c25d4226125fe34645c5b1603fa7c86c76efed1d42263fea0a4e2d0301",
      "evidence_id": "ev-9cb3e5c25d42-0001-0005",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 25,
        "start": 25
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAGAN: Ms. -- Ms. Hansford -- I'm sorry. Were you -- I mean, I'm not sure my question matters at all."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2021-20-1566",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "9cb3e5c25d4226125fe34645c5b1603fa7c86c76efed1d42263fea0a4e2d0301",
      "evidence_id": "ev-9cb3e5c25d42-0001-0006",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 28,
        "start": 28
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: Would you be less comfortable with the position you're taking if at some point in the future the Court were to say that federal law cannot preempt state law simply based on federal interests that are not embodied in a statutory provision that actually conflicts with state law?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2021-20-1566",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "9cb3e5c25d4226125fe34645c5b1603fa7c86c76efed1d42263fea0a4e2d0301",
      "evidence_id": "ev-9cb3e5c25d42-0002-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 46,
        "start": 46
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAGAN: And where do you get that --"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
      "case_id": "2021-20-1566",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "9cb3e5c25d4226125fe34645c5b1603fa7c86c76efed1d42263fea0a4e2d0301",
      "evidence_id": "ev-9cb3e5c25d42-0002-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 49,
        "start": 49
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "CHIEF JUSTICE ROBERTS: Can't the various considerations that you've been talking about be applied fully at the liability stage?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2021-20-1566",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "9cb3e5c25d4226125fe34645c5b1603fa7c86c76efed1d42263fea0a4e2d0301",
      "evidence_id": "ev-9cb3e5c25d42-0002-0003",
